<title>USA: Lands' End joins AOL online shopping venture.</title>
<headline>Lands' End joins AOL online shopping venture.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lands' End said on Wednesday that it will offer its apparel, accessories and other products in cyberspace as part of a venture with America Online Inc.</p>
<p>AOL subscribers will be able to buy clothing, shoes, luggage and other merchandise in a special &quot;outlet style&quot; area that offers overstock at lower-than-usual prices, Lands' End said. The company said AOL's demographics meshes well with that of its current customer base.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
